      "resolvedDescription": "Passive: Attacks deal an additional 2/4/6 (+3% bonus AD) true damage, stacking infinitely. Takedowns against champions and epic monsters leave behind a piece of Void Coral. Active: Bel'Veth consumes a Void Coral, gaining 1 Lavender stack and activating her true form. Void Coral from void epic monsters causes minions that die nearby to become Void Remora. While casting, Bel'Veth Slows nearby enemies before exploding, dealing 150/200/250 (+150% AP) + 20% missing-Health true damage. In her true form, Bel'Veth gains 100/250/400 (+150% bonus AD) (+150% AP) max Health, 25/75/125 Attack range, 6/13/20% Total Attack Speed, and Void Surge can pass through walls. True form lasts 45 seconds, increased to 90 seconds at 40 Lavender stacks. At 80 Lavender stacks, true form lasts until death.",
